{"3951260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Miner to Die", "steam_appid": 3951260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/extras/73c42f7b4c5082c8efd4b822553789f9.avif?t=1787739785\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Go Down The Mine?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then start breaking rocks right away, then break more rocks, and then break even more rocks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/extras/a33bbd07f2b50a4152053e912f3eb6dd.poster.avif?t=1787739785\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/extras/a33bbd07f2b50a4152053e912f3eb6dd.webm?t=1787739785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/extras/a33bbd07f2b50a4152053e912f3eb6dd.mp4?t=1787739785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you won't just be breaking rocks. You'll access different minerals, make different products for more money, loot treasures, and keep earning money to regenerate your constantly decreasing health.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying breaking animations and sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedural mine formation that will truly make you feel like you're in a mine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character development mechanics such as digging speed, damage increase, and health increase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events with both positive and negative impacts in every new mine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly triggered in-game events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based, easy-to-control character movement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, motivational background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards so you can compete with your friends and other players.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Go Down The Mine?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then start breaking rocks right away, then break more rocks, and then break even more rocks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/extras/a33bbd07f2b50a4152053e912f3eb6dd.poster.avif?t=1787739785\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/extras/a33bbd07f2b50a4152053e912f3eb6dd.webm?t=1787739785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/extras/a33bbd07f2b50a4152053e912f3eb6dd.mp4?t=1787739785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you won't just be breaking rocks. You'll access different minerals, make different products for more money, loot treasures, and keep earning money to regenerate your constantly decreasing health.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying breaking animations and sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedural mine formation that will truly make you feel like you're in a mine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character development mechanics such as digging speed, damage increase, and health increase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events with both positive and negative impacts in every new mine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly triggered in-game events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based, easy-to-control character movement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, motivational background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards so you can compete with your friends and other players.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Miner to Die is a survival mining game where you mine for money to regenerate your constantly decreasing health. You can also compete with your friend in the multiplayer escape mode, which can be played with up to 2 players!", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/8998167c568f2b6618267cad783b75e5539063c9/header.jpg?t=1787739785", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/da758d19488db449d6f8e6b30510519d8a51c49a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787739785", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951260/da758d19488db449d6f8e6b30510519d8a51c49a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787739785", "website": "https://mercimekgames.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 Core x64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM (Must support Vulkan)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><